<title>USA: Armco said it has Butler labor agreeent.</title>
<headline>Armco said it has Butler labor agreeent.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Armco Inc said a tentative agreement has been reached on a new contract with the Butler Armco Independent Union.</p>
<p>The company said the agreement covers about 1,900 hourly production and maintenance employees at the Butler, Pa., Operations and would replace a contract that expired September 30.  Details of the contract are not being released.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
